        "category": "ancestry",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>When you need extra mobility, you can leave your cumbersome, protective shell behind. When you don't have your shell, your Speeds increases by 5 feet; you gain a +2 status bonus to Acrobatics, Stealth, and Thievery checks; and you gain weakness to physical damage equal to half your level (rounded up). You can't use any actions that require a shell until you return to your shell by using Shed Shell again. Regrowing a new shell takes 1 week of downtime, but a variety of prosthetic shells are available, as @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.equipment.Item.Prosthetic Limb].</p>"
        },
